    LLM: 'Only order up if you hold both Bowers or an Ace of the proposed trump suit plus at least 2 more trump cards.\n\nVoid Strategy: Having a void suit allows you to trump early. In Buck Euchre, no one is helping youâ€”voids are both an asset (can trump) and a risk (others know your distribution).\n\nCard counting across 4-6 players is difficult. Focus on knowing where the Right Bower is when you hold the Left Bowerâ€”bids with Left Bower only but no Right Bower are very risky.',
